on in 2025, a 37 per cent increase. The workforce has increased from 59 to more than 102 employees in two years, a 22 per cent increase in 2025. Jesús García, CEO of the Nature Group, highlighted that the company’s growth project is strategic because it values the work of farmers in the region.

