t has ever occurred and the most difficult, certainly, in history, but we must also value everything that has been avoided and everything that could have advanced,” he emphasized, concluding by describing the fire control as “good news” for the affected areas of Huelva, “for Huelva, for Andalusia and for all of Spain.”

